Rāma reaches Bharadvāja āśram and asks city welfare --- Bharadvāja says matted Bharata awaits with pādukās in welfare --- Bharadvāja recalls pity at bark exile and joy at victory --- Bharadvāja recounts forest exile search bridge Laṅkā killing and boons by tapas --- Bharadvāja offers boon and arghya for morrow Ayōdhyā journey --- Rāma asks fruited honey trees along road and trees turn fruitful